<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Give</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>give &lt;item&gt; [to] &lt;character&gt;
give &lt;amount&gt; &lt;coins&gt; [to] &lt;character&gt;
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>give bread to asta
give 100 iron pieces to papi
</pre>
<p>This makes it possible to exchange items between characters without having to 
drop them on the ground. You give one thing at a time, from your inventory, to 
someone in the same room. The word to may be left out.
</p><p>Many quests are finished by giving the right thing to the one who asked for it.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Get</a>
